      "message": "GitHub idempotency requires findingDigest equality in addition to head, lane, round, and run identity, so changed findings in the same deterministic round publish a second review marker. This violates the requirement of one marker per lane per round. The regression test at products/aie/test/pr_gate_c.test.cjs:1586 explicitly requires this behavior.",
